  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide Diapers for Vulnerable Children in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide disposable diapers for poor vulnerable children at home and in the rehabilitation centers in Anambra State, to support them. Disposable diapers are believed to be more convenient and sanitary than clothe diapers, keeps a baby dry and less likely to make them suffer from diaper rash. Parents who cannot afford to provide enough diapers for their child are forced to leave their baby in a soiled diaper longer than is appropriate, leading to diaper rash and other infections.</narrative>
  </description>
